  "job_B15.8.630_20251003_114348": {
    "text": "\u00c6rest of Twyforde su\u00f0ward andlang Auene \u00f0\u00e6re ea swa \u00f0\u00e6t mynstre stonde\u00f0 ofer Alne stream on\nAnd swa andlang ea on \u00f0a m\u00e6rdic Fledanbyrig gem\u00e6re.\nAndlang \u00f0\u00e6re dic swa upp on \u00f0a ecgge, and swa \u00feurh \u00f0one graf be \u00f0an aldan swinhagan.\n\u00d0\u00e6t upp on Lencdune.\nSwa andlang dune \u00f0\u00e6t cym\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6r Lencgemeru and Herefordtunes landgem\u00e6ru tog\u00e6dere ligga\u00f0 \u00e6t\n\u00d0\u00e6t swa dun on \u00f0one fulan broc.\nAndlang broces on \u00f0\u00e6t lytle sic.\nAndlang sices on Auene.\nUpp andlang Auene \u00f0\u00e6t on blacan pol.\nOf \u00f0am poole up on \u00f0a ecgge, on piceres homm.\nOf piceres homme swa on \u00f0\u00e6t lytle sceard \u00f0\u00e6t is on burhhlinceas.\nOf \u00f0am hlincean on Bugghilde str\u00e6te.\n\u00d0anon on \u00feegna dene, on stanihtan hyll.\nOf \u00f0am hylle on cyricstige.\nOf cyricstige on \u00f0a blacan \u00feyrnan on easthalfan lytel.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6re \u00feyrnan on \u00f0one blacan pytt, andlang furena on m\u00e6r\u00f0yrnan.\n\u00d0anon on m\u00e6rdic.\nOf m\u00e6rdic on \u00f0a w\u00e6terswylian.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6re swylian on m\u00e6r\u00f0orn.\nOf \u00f0am \u00feorne on \u00f0a lytlan grenan dic.\nOf \u00f0are dic on Hunigburnan.\nSwa andlang streames on \u00f0am stanihtan ford.\nEft on Bugghilde stret.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6re stret westward on \u00e6lfstanes byriels.\nOf \u00f0am byrielse andlang sices on bunewyr\u00f0e.\nOf bunewyr\u00f0e on Hunigburnan.\nOf Hunigburnan on m\u00e6redic.\nOf m\u00e6redic on Baggenbeorge.\nOf Baggenbeorge eft on m\u00e6redic.\nOf m\u00e6redic on Wynburnan.\nOf Wynburnan onlong heafde on \u00f0am beadan \u00feorn.\nOf \u00f0am \u00feorne on wudanhomme.\nOf wudamhomme on pol\u00f0orne.\nOf pol\u00f0orne on Fugelm\u00e6re.\nOf Fugelm\u00e6re on m\u00e6rebroc.\nOnlong broces on \u00f0a blacan \u00feyrne.\nOf \u00f0ere \u00feyrne onlong broces on burhwyllen.\nOf burwylle on burwealles.\nOnlong wealles eft on \u00feeoua dene.\nOf \u00feeoua dene on Eadelming garan.\nOf Ealdelming garan bi Buggild strete \u00f0e men nonesmonneslond nemme\u00f0.\n\u00d0onen onlong weige west to \u00f0e beorges.\nOf \u00f0en beorges on pycrestan.\nOf pycrestane onlong walles on Cadanmynster.\nOf Cadanmynstre on blacan pytt.\nOf \u00f0am pytte onlong ri\u00f0ies on wyllersege.\nOf wylleresegge on sandbroc.\nOf sandbroc onlong furena on hegwege.\nOf hegewege on nor\u00f0om.\nOf nor\u00f0omme on bordri\u00f0ig.\n\u00d0anon on brer\u00f0yrnan.\nOf \u00f0ere \u00feyrna on hecanige.\nOf hecanige on Bedeswyllan.\nOf \u00f0e wyllen innan \u00f0a lytlam \u00feyrnan on westhalue piccedeshoo.\nOf \u00f0ere \u00feyrnan on m\u00e6r\u00f0orn.\nOf m\u00e6r\u00f0orne on Weremundes lawe, onlong furena on Weremodes lawe.\n\u00d0onan on Egsanmore on \u00f0e grendic.\nOf \u00f0ere dic on bradan mere.\nOf bradan m\u00e6re on \u00f0one lytle grene bearh.\n\u00d0onan onlong heafde upon langendune.\nSwa on \u00f0a ealda foxhole.\nOf \u00f0ane hole onlong hricgweges on \u00f0a \u00e6\u00f0enan byrielse, on Ealhmunding wege.\nOf \u00f0am wege eft ongean \u00e6fter dune \u00f0\u00e6t it cym\u00f0 upp on \u00f0one cnolle.\nSo \u00e6fter furlange \u00f0\u00e6t it cym\u00f0 on \u00f0a fyrdstr\u00e6t.\nSwa \u00e6fter str\u00e6te \u00f0at hyt cym\u00f0 on potingdun.\n\u00d0anon on \u00ferittig \u00e6cera.\nOf \u00f0am \u00ferittig \u00e6cera on ricwege.\nOf ricwege on \u00f0a ealdan dic.\nOnlong dices \u00f0\u00e6t on Esigburnan.\nOf Esigburnan upp to \u00f0ere ealdan dic.\nOf \u00f0ere dic on Wylihtmede.\nOf \u00f0er m\u00e6de on m\u00e6rebroc.\nOnlong broces on domnipol.\nOf \u00f0e pole on Ellesbeorh.\nOf \u00f0am beorohge on merwyllan.\nOf merwylle \u00f0\u00e6t hyt cym\u00f0 eft on geriht on Auene.",
